on his head this time.

378
00:28:53.325 --> 00:28:55.127
I wasn't there, I swear.

379
00:28:58.530 --> 00:29:02.434
If you get busted,
you're gonna ruin everything.

380
00:29:07.206 --> 00:29:09.107
