407
00:30:59.318 --> 00:31:01.653
Yeah, my daddy used
to take me hunting.

408
00:31:01.687 --> 00:31:04.323
Taught me how to dress
and hang a buck.

409
00:31:04.356 --> 00:31:07.159
<i>I bet you loved
your dad a whole lot.</i>

410
00:31:07.192 --> 00:31:12.364
Yeah. I did...
when he was sober.

411
00:31:12.397 --> 00:31:16.368
You know what?
We both keep forgetting

412
00:31:16.401 --> 00:31:20.238
- <i>to say "over."</i>
- To say "over." Oops.

413
00:31:20.272 --> 00:31:23.375
Joey, are you talking to someone?

414
00:31:23.408 --> 00:31:25.677
- <i>Good night, Mr. Hamby.</i>
- Joey! What about...

415
